<body>

<header>
    <h1>🌟 About GoodLeaders</h1>
    <p>Inspiring Leaders. Transforming Lives. Building a Better Future.</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="/">Home</a>
    <a href="/about">About</a>
    <a href="/library">Library</a>
    <a href="/announcements">Announcements</a>
    <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<div class="container">

<div class="card highlight">
    <h2>Who We Are</h2>

    <p>
        GoodLeaders is an educational leadership platform created to
        encourage people to learn about leadership, character,
        responsibility, communication, teamwork and personal development.
    </p>

    <p>
        The platform brings together leadership information and
        educational resources in one place so that visitors can discover
        ideas that can help them become more responsible and effective
        members of their communities.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <h2>🎯 Our Mission</h2>

    <p>
        Our mission is to provide accessible and useful leadership
        education while encouraging positive values, responsible
        decision-making and continuous learning.
    </p>

    <p>
        We aim to make leadership learning practical by sharing articles,
        educational resources, discussions and information that visitors
        can apply in school, work, family and community settings.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <h2>🌍 Our Vision</h2>

    <p>
        We envision a community where young people, students, aspiring
        leaders and anyone interested in personal development can find
        useful resources that encourage them to lead with integrity,
        respect and responsibility.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <h2>👥 Who GoodLeaders Is For</h2>

    <p>
        GoodLeaders is designed for people who want to learn more about
        leadership and personal development.
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Students interested in developing leadership skills</li>
        <li>Young people preparing for leadership responsibilities</li>
        <li>People interested in teamwork and communication</li>
        <li>Teachers, mentors and community-minded individuals</li>
        <li>Anyone interested in learning about responsible leadership</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <h2>📚 What We Provide</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>Leadership articles and advice</li>
        <li>Educational resources and library materials</li>
        <li>Leadership announcements</li>
        <li>Member profiles and community features</li>
        <li>Opportunities for constructive discussions</li>
        <li>Resources focused on personal growth and responsible leadership</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <h2>💙 Our Values</h2>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>Integrity</strong> — doing what is right and being trustworthy.</li>
        <li><strong>Respect</strong> — treating other people with dignity.</li>
        <li><strong>Responsibility</strong> — accepting responsibility for our decisions and actions.</li>
        <li><strong>Teamwork</strong> — working positively with others.</li>
        <li><strong>Discipline</strong> — developing good habits and staying committed to worthwhile goals.</li>
        <li><strong>Continuous Learning</strong> — remaining willing to learn, improve and grow.</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <h2>🚀 Our Commitment</h2>

    <p>
        GoodLeaders is intended to grow into a useful online community
        where leadership education and positive ideas can be shared.
        We will continue improving the platform, adding useful resources
        and developing features that make learning and participation
        easier for visitors and members.
    </p>

    <p>
        We believe leadership is not only about holding a position.
        It is also about character, service, responsibility, learning
        and the positive influence a person has on others.
    </p>
</div>

